## Program Objectives

The Falcon X UAV Program develops the next-generation autonomous unmanned aerial vehicle platform for commercial and defense applications.

### Key Deliverables
1. Falcon X-100 Commercial Variant
2. Falcon X-200 Defense Variant
3. Ground Control Station
4. Autonomous Navigation System
5. Payload Integration Platform

